list-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TCO</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mtext>TCO</mtext><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TCO}_{self-hosted} &lt; \\text{TCO}_{api}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时自建有利——但多数团队低估了自建的隐性成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[月 LLM 支出评估] --&gt; B{月支出 &gt; $50K?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[API 优先&lt;br/&gt;自建不划算]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{流量稳定?&lt;br/&gt;波动 &lt; 2x}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[混合架构&lt;br/&gt;基线自建 + 峰值 API]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{有 GPU/ML 团队?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[API + 长期合约折扣]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H{需要模型定制?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[评估 API 长期合约&lt;br/&gt;通常仍有利]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[自建推理集群&lt;br/&gt;开源模型 + 定制]\">graph TD\n    A[月 LLM 支出评估] --&gt; B{月支出 &gt; $50K?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[API 优先&lt;br/&gt;自建不划算]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{流量稳定?&lt;br/&gt;波动 &lt; 2x}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[混合架构&lt;br/&gt;基线自建 + 峰值 API]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{有 GPU/ML 团队?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[API + 长期合约折扣]\n    F --&gt;|是| H{需要模型定制?}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[评估 API 长期合约&lt;br/&gt;通常仍有利]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[自建推理集群&lt;br/&gt;开源模型 + 定制]</pre><h2 id=\"api-采购的真实成本\">API 采购的真实成本</h2><h3 id=\"显性成本\">显性成本</h3><p>按量付费的 token 费用。以一个月 1000 万次调用的系统为例（平均 4000 input + 600 output tokens）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>月 token 成本</th>\n<th>年成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPT-5.2</td>\n<td>$98,000</td>\n<td>$1,176,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5-mini</td>\n<td>$17,000</td>\n<td>$204,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Sonnet 4.6</td>\n<td>$102,000</td>\n<td>$1,224,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Haiku 4.5</td>\n<td>$34,000</td>\n<td>$408,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek-V3</td>\n<td>¥58,000（~$8,000）</td>\n<td>$96,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"隐性成本与风险\">隐性成本与风险</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隐性因素</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>量化估算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>厂商涨价风险</td>\n<td>2026 年初多家涨价 460%+</td>\n<td>难预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟不可控</td>\n<td>高峰期延迟翻倍</td>\n<td>SLA 违约损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据隐私合规</td>\n<td>数据经过第三方</td>\n<td>合规审计成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商锁定</td>\n<td>切换成本高（Prompt 适配）</td>\n<td>3-6 个月迁移成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流/配额</td>\n<td>突发流量被拒</td>\n<td>业务损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"api-的不可替代优势\">API 的不可替代优势</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>零运维负担</strong>：不需要 GPU 集群管理、模型更新、故障恢复</li>\n<li><strong>弹性无限</strong>：流量从 100 到 100 万无需容量规划</li>\n<li><strong>最新模型</strong>：第一时间使用最强模型，无需自己部署</li>\n<li><strong>按量付费</strong>：用多少付多少，无前期投资</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自建推理的真实成本\">自建推理的真实成本</h2><h3 id=\"硬件成本-2026-年参考\">硬件成本（2026 年参考）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU 型号</th>\n<th>购买价格</th>\n<th>租赁价格（月）</th>\n<th>推理吞吐（7B 模型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NVIDIA H100 80GB</td>\n<td>~$30,000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,500-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>4,000</td>\n<td>~150 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVIDIA H200 141GB</td>\n<td>~$32,000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,400-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>4,500</td>\n<td>~180 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVIDIA B200 192GB</td>\n<td>~$45,000+</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>8,000</td>\n<td>~350 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVIDIA A100 80GB</td>\n<td>~$15,000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,500-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>2,500</td>\n<td>~80 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVIDIA L40S</td>\n<td>~$8,000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>1,200</td>\n<td>~60 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMD MI300X</td>\n<td>~$25,000</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>3,500</td>\n<td>~130 tokens/s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的代际变化：A100 已属上一代资产（以二手与存量机房为主），增量算力集中在 H200 与 Blackwell（B200/GB200，原生支持 FP4 精度）；H100 现货租赁价较 2024 年高点明显回落。受出口管制影响的中国市场，自建主力还包括昇腾 910B/C 等国产加速卡（配套 CANN/MindIE 推理栈，成熟度以官方实测为准）。表中吞吐为单卡参考值，实际取决于推理框架、量化方案与 batch 策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"运维与人力成本\">运维与人力成本</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>月成本估算</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ML 工程师（2人）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>50,000</td>\n<td>模型部署、优化、维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevOps/SRE（1人）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>20,000</td>\n<td>集群运维、监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电力</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>5,000/GPU</td>\n<td>数据中心电费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络/存储</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3,000-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>8,000</td>\n<td>带宽、模型存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障损失</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>GPU 宕机期间的业务影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自建的独特优势\">自建的独特优势</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>单位成本锁定</strong>：硬件摊销后边际成本极低</li>\n<li><strong>数据隐私</strong>：数据不离开自有基础设施</li>\n<li><strong>模型定制</strong>：可以微调、量化、蒸馏定制模型</li>\n<li><strong>无限流量</strong>：不受 API 配额限制</li>\n<li><strong>低延迟</strong>：模型就在本地，网络延迟最小</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"盈亏平衡分析\">盈亏平衡分析</h2><h3 id=\"简化模型\">简化模型</h3><p>假设自建一个 8xH100 单节点，运行开源前沿 MoE 的量化版本（以 DeepSeek-V3/R1 级为例：671B 总参 / ~37B 激活；原生 FP8 权重约 700 GB 需跨机部署，社区动态低比特量化版权重可压至 ~130-340 GB、落入单节点——参见 Unsloth 动态量化方案，2025-02）：</p>\n<p>固定月成本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GPU 租赁：8 × <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,500 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span>20,000</li>\n<li>人力分摊：$10,000</li>\n<li>电力/网络：$4,000</li>\n<li><strong>总计：$34,000/月</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>吞吐能力（FP8/INT4 + continuous batching，聚合输出保守估计）：~1,500 tokens/s ≈ 月输出 39 亿 tokens</p>\n<p>等效 API 成本（沿用 1:0.15 的输入输出比口径，月输入 ≈ 输出 × 6.7 ≈ 260 亿 tokens）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对比旗舰中坚 API（Claude Sonnet <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3/M input +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>15/M output）：约 $136,000/月</li>\n<li>对比同能力的开源系低价 API（DeepSeek 官方定价口径，输入 ~¥2/M、输出 ~¥8/M）：约 $12,000/月</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：只对照旗舰中坚 API 时，月用量超过数亿 token 且流量稳定即可显著低于 API——单位硬件吞吐较上一代 dense 70B 算例大幅提升，盈亏平衡点更低了。但 2026 年真正的对照基线是「同能力的最低价 API」：开源前沿模型本身就以低一个数量级的单价通过 API 提供，纯单价维度自建很难胜出。因此自建理由的优先级排序变为：数据隐私/合规 &gt; 极限批量下的单价锁定 &gt; 低延迟与可控性 &gt; 定制微调——「省钱」本身不再是充分条件。</p>\n<p>但这假设了：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>开源模型质量满足需求——质量锚点已升级：开源前沿从「对标闭源轻量级」（Llama 3.1 70B ≈ GPT-4o-mini 一档，2024 年口径）进化到「对标闭源中坚层」。可核验锚点：DeepSeek-R1 论文报告其数学/代码推理与 OpenAI-o1 同档（arXiv:2501.12948，2025-01）；Kimi K2（2025-07 开放权重）、GLM-4.5（2025-07）、Qwen3-235B-A22B（2025-04，Apache 2.0）在 agentic 与编码基准上普遍被认为接近 GPT-5-mini / Claude Sonnet 一档（社区基准观察值，非严格等价）。评估问题从「轻量模型够不够用」变成「中坚层够不够用」</li>\n<li>团队有能力维护推理集群</li>\n<li>利用率保持 &gt; 60%</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"利用率是关键变量\">利用率是关键变量</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>自建有效成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>月固定成本</mtext><mtext>月实际处理 tokens</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>utilization</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{自建有效成本} = \\frac{\\text{月固定成本}}{\\text{月实际处理 tokens}} = \\frac{C_{fixed}}{T_{capacity} \\times \\text{utilization}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自建有效成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月实际处理</span><span class=\"mord\"> tokens</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月固定成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utilization</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU 利用率</th>\n<th>等效 token 单价</th>\n<th>对比 API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>$10/M</td>\n<td>贵于 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>$6/M</td>\n<td>接近 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70%</td>\n<td>$4.3/M</td>\n<td>低于 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>$3.3/M</td>\n<td>显著低于 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>低利用率（&lt;50%）时自建不划算——流量不稳定的场景应该优先使用 API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开源自建的三档选型地图-2026\">开源自建的三档选型地图（2026）</h2><p>自建不再只有「dense 70B」一种答案。按质量-成本梯度，2026 年的开源自建选型大致分三档：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[开源自建三档] --&gt; B[前沿 MoE 档&lt;br/&gt;DeepSeek-V3/R1 / Kimi K2&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-235B / GLM-4.5&lt;br/&gt;8xH100 或 H200 节点起步]&#10;    A --&gt; C[中坚单卡档&lt;br/&gt;gpt-oss-120b MXFP4 / Qwen3-32B&lt;br/&gt;单张 80GB 卡或 24GB 入门卡]&#10;    A --&gt; D[小模型蒸馏档&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-8B / gpt-oss-20b&lt;br/&gt;消费级卡与边缘设备]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; E[约等于闭源中坚层&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5-mini / Claude Sonnet 一档]&#10;    C --&gt; F[官方模型卡称核心推理&lt;br/&gt;接近 o4-mini 一档]&#10;    D --&gt; G[分类/抽取/路由等窄任务]\">graph LR\n    A[开源自建三档] --&gt; B[前沿 MoE 档&lt;br/&gt;DeepSeek-V3/R1 / Kimi K2&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-235B / GLM-4.5&lt;br/&gt;8xH100 或 H200 节点起步]\n    A --&gt; C[中坚单卡档&lt;br/&gt;gpt-oss-120b MXFP4 / Qwen3-32B&lt;br/&gt;单张 80GB 卡或 24GB 入门卡]\n    A --&gt; D[小模型蒸馏档&lt;br/&gt;Qwen3-8B / gpt-oss-20b&lt;br/&gt;消费级卡与边缘设备]\n\n    B --&gt; E[约等于闭源中坚层&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5-mini / Claude Sonnet 一档]\n    C --&gt; F[官方模型卡称核心推理&lt;br/&gt;接近 o4-mini 一档]\n    D --&gt; G[分类/抽取/路由等窄任务]</pre><p>选型含义：先用中坚单卡档覆盖大多数流量——硬件投入最小、运维最简单；当中坚档质量不足时，升级路径是「上前沿 MoE 档」而非「采购更强闭源 API」，这正是混合架构中基线层的候选池。各档与闭源模型的对应关系为社区基准与技术报告的观察值（如 gpt-oss-120b 官方模型卡称其核心推理基准接近 o4-mini），非严格等价声明，落地前应在自有任务集上复测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合架构-最佳实践\">混合架构：最佳实践</h2><p>多数大规模部署最终走向混合架构——兼取两者优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流量层</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>成本特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基线流量（P50 以下）</td>\n<td>自建集群</td>\n<td>固定成本，低单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常波动（P50-P90）</td>\n<td>自建 + 弹性扩展</td>\n<td>混合成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>峰值流量（P90 以上）</td>\n<td>溢出到 API</td>\n<td>按量付费，高弹性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊需求（最强模型）</td>\n<td>API only</td>\n<td>无法自建的能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"路由策略\">路由策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def hybrid_route(request: InferenceRequest) -&gt; Response:&#10;    # 需要旗舰能力 → API&#10;    if request.requires_frontier_model:&#10;        return await api_call(request, model=&quot;claude-opus-4-6&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 自建集群有余量 → 自建&#10;    if self_hosted_cluster.available_capacity() &gt; 0.2:&#10;        return await self_hosted_call(request)&#10;&#10;    # 自建满载 → 溢出到 API（用便宜模型）&#10;    return await api_call(request, model=&quot;claude-haiku-4-5&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hybrid_route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request: InferenceRequest) -> Response:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 需要旗舰能力 → API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.requires_frontier_model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api_call(request, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-opus-4-6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 自建集群有余量 → 自建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self_hosted_cluster.available_capacity() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self_hosted_call(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 自建满载 → 溢出到 API（用便宜模型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api_call(request, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-haiku-4-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"决策清单\">决策清单</h2><p>在做自建 vs API 决策时，逐项评估：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>倾向 API</th>\n<th>倾向自建</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>月支出</td>\n<td>&lt; $20K</td>\n<td>&gt; $50K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量模式</td>\n<td>高波动（&gt;3x 峰谷比）</td>\n<td>稳定（&lt;2x 峰谷比）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型需求</td>\n<td>需要最新旗舰模型</td>\n<td>开源模型质量足够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据敏感度</td>\n<td>一般商业数据</td>\n<td>高敏感（医疗/金融/政务）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队能力</td>\n<td>无 ML infra 团队</td>\n<td>有 GPU/ML 运维经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制需求</td>\n<td>标准 API 满足</td>\n<td>需要微调/量化定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟要求</td>\n<td>秒级可接受</td>\n<td>毫秒级要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规要求</td>\n<td>标准合规</td>\n<td>数据不出境/不出司</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>保守建议</strong>：除非至少满足 4 项&quot;倾向自建&quot;条件，否则 API + 优化策略（路由/缓存/批处理）通常是更优选择。自建的机会成本（工程师时间花在基础设施而非产品）经常被低估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自建 vs API 的决策核心是 TCO 对比和利用率。月支出 &lt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>时</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>优先；</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20K 时 API 优先；&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优先；</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span>50K 且流量稳定时评估自建；利用率 &lt; 50% 时自建不划算。多数团队低估了自建的隐性成本（人力、运维、机会成本），高估了 API 的长期风险。混合架构（基线自建 + 峰值 API）是大规模部署的标准答案。保守建议：除非满足 4 项以上&quot;倾向自建&quot;条件，否则 API + 优化策略通常更优。2026 年的补充判断：开源前沿已同时以低价 API 与开放权重两种形态供给，自建的核心动机从「省单价」转向隐私合规、可控性与定制。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"quantization-distillation-cost\">量化与蒸馏的成本收益</a> 自建场景下通过模型压缩进一步降低推理成本</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自建推理 vs API 采购","id":"自建推理-vs-api-采购"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TCO 视角的选型框架","id":"tco-视角的选型框架"},{"level":2,"text":"API 采购的真实成本","id":"api-采购的真实成本"},{"level":3,"text":"显性成本","id":"显性成本"},{"level":3,"text":"隐性成本与风险","id":"隐性成本与风险"},{"level":3,"text":"API 的不可替代优势","id":"api-的不可替代优势"},{"level":2,"text":"自建推理的真实成本","id":"自建推理的真实成本"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件成本（2026 年参考）","id":"硬件成本-2026-年参考"},{"level":3,"text":"运维与人力成本","id":"运维与人力成本"},{"level":3,"text":"自建的独特优势","id":"自建的独特优势"},{"level":2,"text":"盈亏平衡分析","id":"盈亏平衡分析"},{"level":3,"text":"简化模型","id":"简化模型"},{"level":3,"text":"利用率是关键变量","id":"利用率是关键变量"},{"level":2,"text":"开源自建的三档选型地图（2026）","id":"开源自建的三档选型地图-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"混合架构：最佳实践","id":"混合架构-最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"路由策略","id":"路由策略"},{"level":2,"text":"决策清单","id":"决策清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批处理与异步模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/batch-async-patterns"},"next":{"title":"量化与蒸馏的成本收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/quantization-distillation-cost"}}